Third-party material

src/gen/library/hvsc*.js, standard*.js, corpus data
  Statistics, rhythm patterns and short instrument programs derived from the
  High Voltage SID Collection (https://www.hvsc.c64.org) and its STIL. The
  SID tunes themselves are not included. Credit to the HVSC team and to the
  C64 musicians whose work the collection preserves.
